  "details": "Avatars and Worlds can be Private or Public. This is great for most people, but I would love the option to have the option for \"Friends\" and \"Group\".\n\nThe group option not so much but could be an interesting dynamic for having group communities in certain worlds or avis, but the main focus is that I would LOVE the ability to upload avatars and share them with friends only.\n\nI have a small community of members that I create, manage, and maintain avatars for. I have to jump through hoops to ensure that each of them have their avi uploaded. Packaging them up, sending the files over, some of them I remote in and do the work on their computer for them, and it can be come a hassle at times.\n\nI feel like if i could fully manage the avatars on my end, then upload them with a privacy setting of \"Friends\" will allow people on my friends list to use these avatars, so I can make changes and corrections on a whim without scheduling and delays and all that. I could have my specific avatar account to keep these friends strict and trusted rather than it being my actively played/public account so that I can secure the work they pay for, and get even better service in the end.\n\nBeyond my needs, im sure many others would also find alot of use of sharing avatars with friends only too.",
